<item><title>Malawi airport tells passengers to arrive four hours early amid check-in fault</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-airport-tells-passengers-to-arrive-four-hours-early-459e23/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-airport-tells-passengers-to-arrive-four-hours-early-459e23/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>Kamuzu International Airport has used manual check-in since Nov. 17 after heavy rain and strong winds disrupted its automated service.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:50:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
